      "difficulty": "knowledge-check",
      "stem": "The quadratic formula is $x = \\frac{-b \\pm \\sqrt{b^2 - 4ac}}{2a}$. For $x^2 + 3x - 10 = 0$, what are the values of $a$, $b$ and $c$?",
