      "explanation": "$x = \\frac{4 \\pm \\sqrt{16 - 4}}{2} = \\frac{4 \\pm \\sqrt{12}}{2} = \\frac{4 \\pm 3.464...}{2}$. So $x = 3.73$ or $x = 0.27$ (2 d.p.)."
